     PaneBox[
      StyleBox["\<\"Figure 1. 600 vehicles on the full Aberdeen road network \
(11,925 drivable nodes, 26,453 directed edges after \
strongly-connected-component restriction). Vehicles follow the Intelligent \
Driver Model with hierarchy-weighted noisy routing and staggered entry; 151 \
OSM-tagged signalised junctions and ~1000 roundabout-tagged edges enforce \
intersection control. Colours encode instantaneous speed (green = free flow, \
red = stopped).\"\>",
