      StyleBox["\<\"Figure 3. Animated Payne-Whitham run near a merge zone. \
Unlike LWR the velocity field can drop below equilibrium transiently, \
producing stop-and-go oscillations rather than a clean shock. (MP4: \
Wolfram/results/anim_payne_whitham.mp4.)\"\>",
