 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"144f1592-8e1a-4dc4-a202-5b7696f4dc7c"],

Cell["7. Intersections as queues: M/D/1", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"b282350b-28df-40a0-b75c-bab87887c55b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A signalised intersection looks like a server that alternates between \
available (green) and unavailable (red). If vehicle arrivals are Poisson with \
rate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Lambda]", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "270f414d-a154-4018-a658-507b095d735c"],
 " and service during the green phase is deterministic at rate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Mu]", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "9dc5e5a8-5bfe-441d-90c2-9e53197cc261"],
 ", the steady-state queue length is given by the Pollaczek\[Dash]Khinchine \
formula for an M/D/1 queue,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"98ddf570-17b7-4ce6-87cd-faec35e66c87"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["L", "q"], "=", 
   FractionBox[
    SuperscriptBox["\[Rho]", "2"], 
    RowBox[{"2", "(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "-", "\[Rho]"}], ")"}]]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->"a13fa2e6-66d6-43d0-9f3b-67dd37e64b98"],

Cell["with the same-shape result for the waiting time:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8d24847a-4fca-4d23-a28b-31b452542059"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["W", "q"], "=", 
   FractionBox["\[Rho]", 
    RowBox[{"2", "\[ThinSpace]", "\[Mu]", "\[ThinSpace]", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", "-", "\[Rho]"}], ")"}]}]]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->"a65999f5-ddc9-4e1b-8598-897502124d35"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "both diverging as utilisation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "=", 
    FractionBox["\[Lambda]", "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "22a24c52-f289-4e9a-95f9-e2c4be60102f"],
 " approaches 1. Traffic engineers read the practical threshold ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "=", "0.85"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "b2d2703c-3c51-4076-891a-dd7a9f4a088c"],
 " as the onset of severe congestion. On a tandem of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["n", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "da638a58-e850-4779-ba3f-b3ae89c79445"],
 " signalised intersections along a corridor we approximate total delay by \
summing the per-intersection delays (a Jackson-network approximation that \
ignores platoon-preservation between signals but is accurate enough for \
first-pass planning)."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"aaf63cf3-8334-4b94-84ed-288c01a554ef"],

